  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the program is to support epidemic control by targeting testing to efficiently identify PLHIV, ensuring all newly diagnosed PLHIV are immediately linked to treatment, and all PLHIV on treatment have ready access to antiretroviral therapy (ART), are retained on treatment, and remain virally suppressed.</narrative>
  </description>
